{"unit_id": "tag:0C6J:proof", "translation": "注意到<MATH_0001>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，因为只要存在一个相对于<MATH_0002>丰沛（ample）的可逆模（invertible module），<MATH_0003>就必定是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。由所引用的引理，态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是开浸入（open immersion）。另一方面，<MATH_0005>的像（image）是闭（closed）的，这由引理<REF_0001>得出（<MATH_0006>的靶对象（target）在<MATH_0007>上是分离（separated）的，见《构造》中的引理<REF_0002>）。最后，<MATH_0008>的像（image）是稠密（dense）的，这由《性质》中的引理<REF_0003>得出（这里还用到了引理<REF_0004>的证明中所得的结论，即态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>的仿射开集（affine opens）上由《性质》中引理<REF_0005>的典范态射（canonical morphism）给出）。因此可知，<MATH_0011>是满射（surjective）的开浸入（open immersion），即同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible module", "target_term": "可逆模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "靶对象"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "dense", "target_term": "稠密"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "开头断言的拟紧性。"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "可逆模的相对丰沛性。"}, {"source_term": "invertible module", "target_term": "可逆模", "context": "用其存在性推出拟紧性。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "由可逆模的存在性推出的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由所引引理判定为开浸入的态射。"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "所引用引理给出的态射性质。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "被证明为闭的像。"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "描述态射的像为闭集。"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "靶对象", "context": "指态射的目标对象。"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "描述靶对象在指定基上的性质。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "被证明为稠密的像。"}, {"source_term": "dense", "target_term": "稠密", "context": "描述态射的像的稠密性。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "在仿射开集上由典范态射给出的态射。"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "用来描述态射的仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "《性质》所引引理中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "结论中开浸入的满射性。"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "结论中的满射开浸入。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "对满射开浸入的等价表述。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0EKE:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是普遍闭（universally closed）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是一个相对于<MATH_0003>丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）<MATH_0004>-模（module）。设<MATH_0005>。则<MATH_0006>是仿射（affine）态射（morphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭", "context": "首个假设中对态射的普遍闭性要求。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "首个假设中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "所设模的相对丰沛性。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "所设模的可逆性。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指定结构下的模。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "引理结论给出的态射性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理结论中的仿射态射。"}], "notes": []}
